        </div>
        <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white font-poppins max-w-4xl mb-3 leading-tight">Más Allá de Positano: Descubriendo las Calas Escondidas de la Costa Amalfitana</h1>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img alt="Avatar de la autora" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/30 object-cover shrink-0" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCdQIiLTaSWXgqvwuVkEFqYULTcNbvI-Fuoi_bsPlONEdISQs1jdFQiTVkLRyqr6zZNR_lIG4F9Hy4it321RArPM7BkUCeptzsLQAliJqd4uMpPbsEWCirdMqdJ2v0NYYWLpP1-zSQCoNGYKC10UnUbUTfmJ9jUVw9AsA6MSok_f4qxDy1v3imvu8VbwDZzHstVhtmikfu561ZSeqrhDNJODrRhAr9r5bQX41hiJuDFFWfEQZ8q6xLWawmK4B9RUsvomtvoZGpPqjmk"/>
          <div class="text-white min-w-0">
